inally comes from  the lords of the long box provided by  mikey sutton i'll put a link for their  channel  down below and let's talk about what  they had to say the report goes  as follows the fantastic four is a  family and that means  more than just a husband a wife a  brother and a best friend  in the mcu kevin feige wants a fresh  look at the fantastic four  one that pays homage to its comic book  roots but  one that adds a little bit more polish  than what fox did with their fantastic  four  having initially attempted to do the  fantastic four right but ultimately  failed according to mikey sutton his  sources say that there will be no  waiting in the marvel cinematic universe  for  franklin richards the son of sue storm  and reed richards and also one of the  most  powerful omega-level mutants that the  marvel universe has ever seen  according to mikey sutton marvel  studios's plan is to have franklin  richards with the fantastic  four from the very beginning and  immediately the fantastic four will look  different than any  other superhero team that we've seen in  the marvel cinematic universe because  they will have a child and not just any  child but an omega level mutant and  one of the most powerful characters in  all of the marvel  universe's history for example at one  point in time he even  resurrects a dead galactus and he then  commands him  as a puppet to fight the celestials with  him and they both defeat them  with ease but the news doesn't stop  there according to sutton marvel would  then like to spin off franklin richards  for  a power pack disney plus series  something that we've heard about now for  a pretty long time  but now we know that franklin richards  is going to be a part of this project  as well and that is mikey's report again  coming from lords of the long box  so this is actually a really great way  to introduce the fantastic four with  them already having  franklin richards and this also means  that we're not going to get  a typical origin story with the  fantastic  four it could almost be like a  spider-man homecoming type of film we  didn't see  peter get bit by the spider or perhaps  like captain marvel it was kind of an  origin story but they did it in a very  different  unique way that was quite enjoyable now  there's no doubt that they'll definitely  go over how they got their powers in the  marvel cinematic universe and what  they've been up to this entire time  while the avengers were defending the  earth because if they're going to  introduce the fantastic four with  already having franklin richards that  means they've most likely had their  powers for a pretty long time  unless they do decide to change their  origin just a little bit and perhaps  franklin richards gets his powers along  with his parents  his uncle and the thing and right now  there are  more than plenty of theories about how  the fantastic four could get their  powers in the mcu the most popular one  right now is that they could get them  from  the quantum realm the fantastic four in  the comics are deeply connected to  the negative zone and annihilus a  villain that we will most likely  see coming up within the next few years  of the mcu and it would be pretty easy  for marvel studios to simply turn the  negative zone  into the quantum realm and the quantum  realm is going to play a very big part  of the mcu moving forward it wasn't just  used for time travel in avengers end  game but we actually have confirmation  from marvel studios themselves that it's  going to be a big part of the future and  we're going to see it relatively soon  the biggest thing that we know about it  so far is the quantum  city that we saw in ant-man and the wasp  people at marvel themselves told us to  look out for this and told us that it is  going to be an important part of  future events this could be where  annihilus is hiding this could be where  the fantastic four could possibly be  trapped and that's where they end up  getting their powers from because  janet van dyne was trapped inside the  quantum realm and by the time that she  got out she said that she had sort of  evolved and now we saw that she had  specific powers she was able to heal  ghost there's so much we didn't know  about this place henry  worlds upon worlds entire civilizations  far  more than we ever theorized so perhaps  the fantastic four do end up getting  stuck  inside of the quantum realm and that's  how they get their powers in the mcu  not to mention this would start to  connect the fantastic four who have not  been in the mcu with other characters  that have been for a pretty long time so  there's a possibility that we could see  the fantastic four  in the next ant-man film ant-man 3. but  mikey sutton also reported in the past  through my youtube channel that  the illuminati are going to be making  their way to the mcu and recently we  have gotten new reports about  this as well but in mikey's original  report it said that the illuminati are  going to be making an appearance in  doctor strange in the multiverse of  madness now for those of you who may not  know the lineup of the illuminati it's  iron man  doctor strange namor the submariner  black bolt  professor xavier and mr fantastic of the  fantastic  four now if this ends up being what  marvel studios decides to do  that means we will see not only  professor xavier and the x-men in phase  four but  the fantastic four mr fantastic and  phase four as well  and this means that the x-men and the  fantastic four are not too far away from  their official  marvel cinematic universe debut at 2019  san diego comic con kevin feige did  mention the fantastic four and he did  mention the mutants so we know that  marvel studios has definitely already  begun their plans of what they plan to  do to introduce them and what stories  they want to tell  now recently we have gotten some other  reports concerning the fantastic four  from  roger wardell or at least an account  claiming to be him  roger wardell was the person who leaked  a ton of information about avengers  in-game and phase 4  all of which ended up being correct now  his old account hasn't posted in a bit  and there's a new account that has  arised and which he says  is his new account because he got kicked  out of his old account there's no way to  really know but he was 100  accurate about all of the other leaks in  the past so hopefully it is him but  take this information with a grain of  salt but in recent reports he has said  that john  krasinski and emily blunt who everybody  wants to play mr fantastic  and the invisible woman are in fact  being courted for mcu roles  but not the fantastic four marvel is  looking at fresh faces for the first  family he says that names that are being  thrown around to play at reed richards  in the mcu include  lakeith stanfield and matthew gray  gubler  but another very interesting thing in  this report is that he says  after two decades peyton reed will  finally get his hands on the fantastic  four  but not in a fantastic four film  now for those of you who are unaware  peyton reed directed ant-man  and ant-man and the wasp but something  that you may not know is that he has  wanted to direct and write a fantastic  four film for a  very very long time in fact years ago he  wrote a fantastic four script  that took place in the 1960s and he  pitched it to fox  now obviously since we don't have that  movie it did not get made  but he's been wanting to write and  direct a fantastic four film for a while  and this report says that he's going to  get his chance but it's not going to be  a fantastic four  film well since he's directed ant-man 1  and ant-man of the wasp and is going to  direct ant-man 3 there's a high  possibility that we could see the  fantastic  four in ant-man 3. this is what the  report would mean by he would get to  direct the fantastic four but it  wouldn't be a film it will be ant-man 3  and the fantastic four will be in the  film and as i mentioned before there are  plenty of ways to  introduce the fantastic four in ant-man  3 especially when we're going to be  talking about the quantum realm and not  to mention we still don't know  what the building and spider-man far  from home was  there was the fantastic four teaser in  front of this new building that said  we can't wait to show you what comes  next along with the numbers  one two three and then nothing implying  that  four the fantastic four are what's  coming next so the building the new  avengers tower and spider-man far from  home could be the baxter building the  home  to the fantastic four and that timing  kind of aligns the events of spider-man  3  and the events of ant-man 3. so bringing  them into ant-man 3 having them take  their baxter building in downtown new  york would all fit perfectly  in the marvel cinematic universe as it  is right now and as it will  be so let me know what you think about  this new report about the fantastic four  coming to the mcu  with franklin richards one of the most  powerful characters that marvel has ever  seen  let me know what you think in the  comments down below also don't forget to  like the video and subscribe to stay up  to date on all  mcu related news for live updates you  can follow me on twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching  woof

